  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Touching down under bright island skies, Muranishi reminds his excited crew that they are here to work, not sightsee, before greeting their cheerful local coordinator at the airport van. Listen to the Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "うわあ、すげえ！ハワイだ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お前ら、観光じゃないんだからしっかりしろよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "サファイア映像の皆さんですか？皆さんよろしく！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "じゃあ荷物を積んじゃってください。こっちになります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "すいません、これ重いんで運んでもらっていいですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "あなた細いね。筋肉つけたほうがいいね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "監督の村西だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "彼女は来るんだろうな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "先に到着して、今はホテルで休んでますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "でも大丈夫ですか？大物女優の扱いは大変ですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "それは楽しみだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "この人、やっぱり日本人なんじゃないですか？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "うわあ、すげえ！ハワイだ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whoa, awesome! We're in Hawaii!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お前ら、観光じゃないんだからしっかりしろよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, this isn't sightseeing, so pull yourselves together.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "サファイア映像の皆さんですか？皆さんよろしく！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you everyone from Sapphire Pictures? Nice to meet you all!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "じゃあ荷物を積んじゃってください。こっちになります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well then, go ahead and load your luggage. Right this way.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "すいません、これ重いんで運んでもらっていいですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Excuse me, this is heavy—could you help me carry it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "あなた細いね。筋肉つけたほうがいいね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You're skinny, aren't you? You ought to put on some muscle.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "監督の村西だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm Muranishi, the director.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "彼女は来るんだろうな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She is definitely coming, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "先に到着して、今はホテルで休んでますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She arrived ahead of you and is resting at the hotel right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "でも大丈夫ですか？大物女優の扱いは大変ですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you going to be okay, though? Handling a big-name actress is tough.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "それは楽しみだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm looking forward to that.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "この人、やっぱり日本人なんじゃないですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Isn't this guy actually Japanese after all?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
